%% WiFi Test Orchestrator architecture baseline 0.1.0
flowchart TB
    User[Authorized user]
    Agent[Agent clients]

    subgraph Server[Linux OCI server services]
        Web[React web frontend]
        API[FastAPI service]
        Orchestrator[Scheduler and orchestrator]
        Worker[Execution workers]
        Telemetry[Telemetry ingestion]
        Artifacts[Artifact service]
        Integrations[Integration adapters]
        Notifications[Notification adapter]
    end

    Postgres[(PostgreSQL)]
    Redis[(Redis)]
    Store[(Filesystem or S3 compatible store)]
    Infrastructure[Authorized infrastructure]
    Push[FCM and APNs]

    User -->|HTTPS| Web
    Web -->|API v1 HTTPS| API
    Agent -->|Outbound HTTPS| API
    Agent -->|Telemetry| Telemetry
    Agent -->|Artifact upload| Artifacts

    API --> Postgres
    API --> Redis
    API --> Orchestrator
    Orchestrator --> Postgres
    Orchestrator --> Redis
    Redis --> Worker
    Worker --> Postgres
    Telemetry --> Postgres
    Artifacts --> Postgres
    Artifacts --> Store
    Worker --> Integrations
    Integrations --> Infrastructure
    API --> Notifications
    Notifications --> Push
